<title>GREECE: AUSTRALIAN PM BROWN TO VISIT GREECE SEPT 6.</title>
<headline>AUSTRALIAN PM BROWN TO VISIT GREECE SEPT 6.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's Prime Minister Dean Brown will visit Greece on Friday on a business mission, joined by cabinet officials and businessmen, the Thessaloniki Chamber of Commerce and Industry said on Monday.</p>
<p>Brown will have business meetings and speak on business opportunities and incentives in south Australia, the chamber said. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
